OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to move urgent treatment
OL,4,Acentre submitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been submitted to relocate
OL,7,Fan urgent treatment centre (UTC) as
OL,8,Fpart of a bid to improve the service.
OL,10,FUnited Lincolnshire Teaching Hospitals
OL,11,FNHS Trust wants to relocate Skegness
OL,12,FUTC from its current location at the
OL,13,Fcommunity hospital in Dorothy Avenue to
OL,14,Fa purpose-built extension at the
OL,15,FSkegness Community Diagnostic Centre on
OL,16,FOld Wainfleet Road.
OL,18,FOfficials said the move would improve
OL,19,Fhealth services for people in the town,
OL,20,Ftreat up to 65,000 patients per year
OL,21,Fand operate 24 hours a day.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
